{
 "_what": "Measured cost of the narrated Sales vs Previous Year run after the cost work on branch cost/sales-yoy-narrated-summary (docs/sales-yoy-narrated-cost-prompt.md), recorded 2026-09-11 against the live SB Mart model. Beside baseline_2026-09.json, which measured the investigated pipeline.",
 "_how": "Isolated local runs: report_ai_tier narrated, blob upload, publishing, history and plan cache off, memory local and empty, so every finding is new. Receipts from src/tools/token_usage.py; writer outcomes from summary_authoring_attempts.json.",
 "_read_this": "Compare day_usd, not total.usd. Runs made back to back read each other's prompt cache, which a once-a-day job never has, so day_usd reprices each writer's first call at the uncached rate and keeps a writer's own retries as billed. Per-year figures assume one run a day (365 runs).",
 "_source": "outputs_bench_narrated/<experiment>/ (gitignored run artifacts)",
